{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17090","headline":"和黄门武相公诏还题石门洞 · 赵宗儒","name":"和黄门武相公诏还题石门洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"益部恩辉降，同荣汉相还。\n韶芳满归路，轩骑出重关。\n望日朝天阙，披云过蜀山。\n更题风雅韵，永绝翠嵓间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵宗儒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}